Ticket #4471 was marked known. The desk merged the reports as one parser bug: the shared parser reads dates month-first, and these tenants write the day first.

The cause table keeps the parser rows on #4471. Those rows are the parser ticket. The hint rows were merged into the same ticket and have none of their own: booking-v3 prints MM/DD/YYYY, the person types the month first, and the form reads the day first. The hint ticket is the second problem.

<Callout kind="warn">
The parser fix does not cover the hint rows. They need a ticket of their own.
</Callout>

